{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1000_020meg", "source_sha256": "1f0704b80eee3390995022964b13309085a8c07bb0e11799ea5f4f737cbf30fe", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}、丁度いいとこに！\nちょっと相談したいことがあるんだけど、いいかな？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，你来得正好！\n我有件事想跟你商量一下，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3771228c4512a703ad51229b2c018ea75b8bb97fcbdc55bce931315364469387", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だよ。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "啊，可以啊。怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "f2363ad979b46bb474d43b03bf4bf17abe8f9e3398615ac7a573cccf24bb1b27", "ja": "アタシの学校の友達なんだけどさ……\n初詣で引いたおみくじが大凶だったんだって。", "zh": "是我学校里的朋友啦……\n听说她去新年参拜抽到的签是大凶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "025d8aff2a86e51f0206b6adf64450cb3331abf9d1ddfb0ea8cc1c4e66bd702b", "ja": "本人は気にしてなかったんだけど、何もないところで\n躓いたり、忘れ物が増えたりしてさ……。", "zh": "她本人倒是不在意，可是不知道为什么总会被绊一下，忘带东西的次数也变多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "876476b3c9dbbee948841ce5a2f2cc3ef3d58933417a8b8932271bb687fe179b", "ja": "偶然かもしれないけど……。\nそういうのが重なると、なーんか気になるじゃない？", "zh": "也许只是巧合……  \n但这种事一件接一件的，就总觉得有点在意，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1005_p", "source_sha256": "be40f31e4c3025e54c174ed22ccb1e9be80a266537972c39483567f8a9f4e963", "ja": "ああ、わかるよ。おみくじとは関係がないとしても、\nなんとなく、そう思ってしまうんだよな。", "zh": "啊，我懂。就算和抽签没关系，\n也会不由得这么想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "a306cb6d4b195a83f5ce0a80ebb47f4b119eb48f5102c019b69159125fb3ac3b", "ja": "そうそう！　それに気にすればするほど、\n余計に気になっちゃうっていうか……。", "zh": "对对！而且越是在意，就越会忍不住去在意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9fba8fae6fa54419cc4e16cf03047b27d743a6059a2f75b98ff98956c572b7bb", "ja": "あー。悪循環というか……。\n一度陥ったら、なかなか抜け出せないんだよな。", "zh": "啊——这可以说是恶性循环吧……\n一旦陷入进去，就很不容易摆脱出来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "44d01fbd2c8cda4ed17b2f4b0ee5fc74c8432d250a56d873f99acac11a516e66", "ja": "そう！　それなんだよ、{$P$}！\nアタシの相談したいこと！", "zh": "没错！就是这个，{$P$}！\n我想找你商量的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1009_p", "source_sha256": "181f7e993899b9fc29afb0379ea0eb16407989465bbdf49b667270e500983deb", "ja": "……？　どういうことだ、恵美。", "zh": "……？　这是怎么回事啊，惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "2f521d323ae8573e90acdbd85e51bf279ac8a7ef40eb3c5fb20fc84300f86cae", "ja": "アタシ、その子をライブに招待したい！　アタシ達の\nライブを見たら、悪い考えもどっか行っちゃうでしょ？", "zh": "我想邀请那孩子来看演出！只要看了我们的演出，坏念头也会不知不觉消失的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1011_p", "source_sha256": "021f047a96ca100e1881aa6a79906f9cc730e5f61d6d37f28710f7b401618472", "ja": "ははっ、その通りだ。……よし。\nそういうことなら席の準備は任せておいてほしい！", "zh": "哈哈，正是如此。……好。\n既然这样，座位的准备就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "0770687fcefe2622c049844cff6a48d41e165a10e08e48b7b0b08d8bc3edfa13", "ja": "さっすが{$P$}♪\nありがとう！", "zh": "不愧是{$P$}♪\n谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "2a3ef0363eea69f6ba1ada3e494107845acd42ab0ac6c47da0bcc2e3ab5f296c", "ja": "よーし！　アタシも、みんなが思いっきり\nハッピーになるように頑張るぞー！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "好——！我也要努力让大家都开开心心的！喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "a0a682cfb0148741cf1b5b8d1c3c2124f3a49bd9eaa3672b8e85774813f85927", "ja": "アタシのおみくじ運も特別大放出だ～！", "zh": "我的抽签运也要特别大放送啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0443_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0443_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ff3bfdec072029855f0deb94732b72277fdefe4f4388c866a156cacac1e47545", "ja": "（その後、恵美の友達は元気になったらしい。恵美の\n優しい気持ちが、神様に届いたのかもしれないな！）", "zh": "（之后，听说惠美的朋友恢复精神了。也许是惠美温柔的心意传达给了神明吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
